The\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Sages
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0are Link's five divine companions in\'a0
\f2\i Tears of the Kingdom
\f0\i0 , each representing an element and a sacred vow made to the ancient king Rauru. Unlike the Champions of\'a0
\f2\i Breath of the Wild
\f0\i0 , the Sages in TotK actively fight alongside Link rather than providing passive abilities from Divine Beasts. Each Sage is unlocked by completing a specific Temple and activating a Vow by touching a unique Sage's Medallion. This guide covers all five Sages, their backstory, abilities, and upgrade path.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26\fsmilli13200 \cf5 \cb3 \strokec5 Tulin \'97 Sage of Wind\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs22\fsmilli11400 \cf4 \strokec4 Race:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Rito\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Temple:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Wind Temple (Hebra region, sky island)\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Ability:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Tulin's Gust \'97 fires a wind burst that propels Link forward and extends glide distance\
Tulin is the son of Teba, a warrior from\'a0
\f2\i BotW
\f0\i0 . He is enthusiastic, brave, and eager to prove himself. His wind ability is the most movement-focused of all sages, enabling Link to cross vast distances and ascend wind columns more effectively.\

\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Best Use:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Exploration, crossing large gaps, sky island traversal\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26\fsmilli13200 \cf5 \strokec5 Riju \'97 Sage of Lightning\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs22\fsmilli11400 \cf4 \strokec4 Race:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Gerudo\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Temple:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Lightning Temple (Gerudo Desert)\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Ability:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Riju's Lightning \'97 creates a lightning aura; arrows fired during the aura trigger immediate thunder strikes\
Riju is the chief of the Gerudo, continuing her leadership from\'a0
\f2\i Age of Calamity
\f0\i0 \'a0lore. She is confident and strategic. Her lightning ability is the highest-damage sage power for bow-users.\

\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Best Use:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Combat, wet-environment enemies, armored foes, crowd control\
