\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Ability:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Sidon's Blessing \'97 creates a water barrier that absorbs hits and detonates as a water explosion\
Sidon returns from\'a0
\f2\i BotW
\f0\i0 \'a0as Zora's Domain's beloved prince-turned-king. His calm confidence complements his defensive ability perfectly.\

\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Best Use:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Defense, fire enemy counters, timed burst damage windows\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f3\b\fs26\fsmilli13200 \cf5 \strokec5 Yunobo \'97 Sage of Fire\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs22\fsmilli11400 \cf4 \strokec4 Race:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Goron\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Temple:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Fire Temple (Death Mountain Depths)\'a0
\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Ability:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Yunobo's Charge \'97 launches Yunobo as a rolling fireball at a targeted direction\
Yunobo is the descendant of Daruk from\'a0
\f2\i BotW
\f0\i0 , though in TotK he has unfortunately been influenced by Marbled Gohma's manipulation. After the Fire Temple, he returns to his true cheerful self.\

\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Best Use:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Mining ore, breaking Talus weakpoints, fire damage, cave combat\
