\f3\b\fs26\fsmilli13200 \cf5 \strokec5 Mineru \'97 Sage of Spirit\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa320\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs22\fsmilli11400 \cf4 \strokec4 Race:
