\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Ability:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Construct Piloting \'97 Link pilots Mineru's giant Zonai Construct mech directly\
Mineru is Rauru's sister and one of the original ancient Zonai who came to Hyrule. She speaks through her spirit stored in the Construct. Unlike other sages, she does not follow Link \'97 she is summoned as a rideable vehicle.\

\f1\b \cf4 \strokec4 Best Use:
\f0\b0 \cf2 \strokec2 \'a0Heavy combat, mining, dangerous enemy clearing, Depths exploration\
